What changed from the parent: tablet_omar moved from chair_k1 to nightstand_b1 for his morning hours; explicit OUT_OF_HOUSE blocks added for Yuki's full work kit; the "tablet in kitchen chair on weekday evening" claim is dropped (Omar is at work 14:00–23:00, and in the morning he's in the bedroom).

What would refute this: finding tablet_omar at chair_k1 during 10:00–13:00 on a weekday; finding Yuki's keys, laptop, or phone inside the house between 09:00 and 17:00 on a weekday; finding either helmet or bike lock out of the house on a weekday morning.

